E AX3073 1381-private-struct-forge.ax:12:12-14 undeclared-unsafe "`main` forges `Map Int` out of `Int` with `as`, and its declaration does not say so" #"forges a reference" ?11:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"this fires where the unsafe operation is performed, not up the call chain. The tag makes the declaration a trusted encapsulation, whose callers inherit nothing. If the operation is not wanted here the fix is to stop performing it, not to stop saying so"
